#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/perl.xml:44
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This version of Perl builds the Compress::Raw::Zlib and Compress::Raw::BZip2"
" modules. By default Perl will use an internal copy of the sources for the "
"build.  Issue the following command so that Perl will use the libraries "
"installed on the system:"
msgstr ""
"Essa versão do Perl constrói os módulos Compress::Raw::Zlib e "
"Compress::Raw::BZip2. Por padrão, Perl usará uma cópia interna dos fontes "
"para a construção. Emita o seguinte comando de modo que o Perl usará as "
"bibliotecas instaladas no sistema:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/perl.xml:50
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">export BUILD_ZLIB=False\n"
"export BUILD_BZIP2=0</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">export BUILD_ZLIB=False\n"
"export BUILD_BZIP2=0</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/perl.xml:53
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To have full control over the way Perl is set up, you can remove the "
"<quote>-des</quote> options from the following command and hand-pick the way"
" this package is built. Alternatively, use the command exactly as shown "
"below to use the defaults that Perl auto-detects:"
msgstr ""
"Para ter controle completo sobre a maneira como o Perl é configurado, você "
"pode remover as opções <quote>-des</quote> do comando seguinte e escolher "
"manualmente a maneira como esse pacote é construído. Alternativamente, use o"
" comando exatamente como mostrado abaixo para usar os padrões que o Perl "
"detecta automaticamente:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/perl.xml:58
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">sh Configure -des                                          \\\n"
"             -D prefix=/usr                                \\\n"
"             -D vendorprefix=/usr                          \\\n"
"             -D privlib=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/core_perl      \\\n"
"             -D archlib=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/core_perl      \\\n"
"             -D sitelib=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/site_perl      \\\n"
"             -D sitearch=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/site_perl     \\\n"
"             -D vendorlib=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/vendor_perl  \\\n"
"             -D vendorarch=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/vendor_perl \\\n"
"             -D man1dir=/usr/share/man/man1                \\\n"
"             -D man3dir=/usr/share/man/man3                \\\n"
"             -D pager=\"/usr/bin/less -isR\"                 \\\n"
"             -D useshrplib                                 \\\n"
"             -D usethreads</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">sh Configure -des                                          \\\n"
"             -D prefix=/usr                                \\\n"
"             -D vendorprefix=/usr                          \\\n"
"             -D privlib=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/core_perl      \\\n"
"             -D archlib=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/core_perl      \\\n"
"             -D sitelib=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/site_perl      \\\n"
"             -D sitearch=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/site_perl     \\\n"
"             -D vendorlib=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/vendor_perl  \\\n"
"             -D vendorarch=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/vendor_perl \\\n"
"             -D man1dir=/usr/share/man/man1                \\\n"
"             -D man3dir=/usr/share/man/man3                \\\n"
"             -D pager=\"/usr/bin/less -isR\"                 \\\n"
"             -D useshrplib                                 \\\n"
"             -D usethreads</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/perl.xml:74
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the new Configure options:"
msgstr "O significado das novas opções do \"Configure\":"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/perl.xml:77
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>-D pager=\"/usr/bin/less -isR\"</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>-D pager=\"/usr/bin/less -isR\"</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/perl.xml:79
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This ensures that <userinput>less</userinput> is used instead of "
"<userinput>more</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"Isso garante que o <userinput>less</userinput> seja usado em vez do "
"<userinput>more</userinput>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/perl.xml:85
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D man1dir=/usr/share/man/man1 -D "
"man3dir=/usr/share/man/man3</parameter>"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D man1dir=/usr/share/man/man1 -D "
"man3dir=/usr/share/man/man3</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/perl.xml:88
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Since Groff is not installed yet, <command>Configure</command> will not "
"create man pages for Perl.  These parameters override this behavior."
msgstr ""
"Uma vez que o Groff ainda não está instalado, <command>Configure</command> "
"não criará páginas de manual para o Perl. Esses parâmetros substituem esse "
"comportamento."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/perl.xml:95
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>-D usethreads</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>-D usethreads</parameter>"

